ly, the ultimate way to do that in a very cost-effective way.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/08/nice-ltd-nice-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"NICE 2019 Q3","e":"nice","d":"2019-11-14","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Beth Gaspich","x":"If you look on the year throughout 2019, we've actually raised guidance on EPS throughout the year and in terms of the top line, we just increased the revenue last quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/14/nice-ltd-nice-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"NICE 2020 Q1","e":"nice","d":"2020-05-14","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Eran Liron","x":"But given the uncertainty of the economic conditions, we are withdrawing our annual guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/14/nice-ltd-nice-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"NICE 2020 Q1","e":"nice","d":"2020-05-14","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Beth Gaspich","x":"And therefore, we are withdrawing our full-year guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/14/nice-ltd-nice-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"NICE 2020 Q2","e":"nice","d":"2020-08-06","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Barak Eilam","x":"We signed a seven-digit cloud deal with a well-known media streaming company as well as a seven-digit deal with a large financial services company, and they are transforming to a common cloud platform.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/06/nice-ltd-nice-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"NICE 2020 Q2","e":"nice","d":"2020-08-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Beth Gaspich","x":"You're correct that given the recent events this year, we have been able to see some reduction in cost savings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/06/nice-ltd-nice-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"NICE 2020 Q3","e":"nice","d":"2020-11-12","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Barak Eilam","x":"There was also a seven-digit cloud deal with the worldwide streaming music provider.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/12/nice-ltd-nice-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NICE 2020 Q4","e":"nice","d":"2021-02-18","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Rishi Jaluria","x":"And then, on the cost side, I'm sure you've gotten a lot of cost savings as a result of just not having any effectively zero TV budgets and not having a physical conference.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/18/nice-ltd-nice-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NICE 2020 Q4","e":"nice","d":"2021-02-18","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Rishi Jaluria","x":"Which are going to be permanent cost savings?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/18/nice-ltd-nice-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NICE 2021 Q1","e":"nice","d":"2021-05-13","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Barak Eilam","x":"Our extensive investment in the past few years in AI led to the introduction of Enlighten.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/13/nice-ltd-nice-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NICE 2021 Q2","e":"nice","d":"2021-08-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Beth Gaspich","x":"So, you're correct that we've just recently revised and increased our full-year guidance with 11% growth expected at the midpoint of our guidance for 2021.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/05/nice-ltd-nice-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NICE 2021 Q2","e":"nice","d":"2021-08-05","l":"ai_disruption","r":"management","s":"Barak Eilam","x":"This business has a ton of opportunity given digital banking and the digital disruption in financial services, and the whole notion of AI analytics.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/05/nice-ltd-nice-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NICE 2026 Q2","e":"nice","d":"2026-08-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Scott Russell","x":"That shift is driving enterprises to scale customer engagement and AI across their organizations, expanding their investment in NICE.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/nice-nice-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NICE 2026 Q2","e":"nice","d":"2026-08-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Beth Gaspich","x":"Consistent with the investment framework we outlined earlier this year, we continue to invest in AI innovation, go-to-market initiatives and our partner ecosystem.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/nice-nice-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NICE 2026 Q2","e":"nice","d":"2026-08-05","l":"ai_disruption","r":"management","s":"Scott Russell","x":"Recent wins, including displacing AI-native point solution at a large multinational utility, where our platform delivered stronger automation performance while giving the customer greater flexibility and faster time to market for new use cases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/nice-nice-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NICE 2026 Q2","e":"nice","d":"2026-08-05","l":"ai_disruption","r":"management","s":"Scott Russell","x":"We also replaced an incumbent AI native solution at a large insurance company after winning a competitive evaluation against an AI native solution and a large enterprise software platform.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/nice-nice-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NICE 2026 Q3","e":"nice","d":"2026-11-04","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Beth Gaspich","x":"We now expect to finish the year slightly above the high end of our 25% to 26% operating margin range, while continuing to invest in AI innovation, go-to-market initiatives and our partner ecosystem.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/04/nice-nice-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NICE 2026 Q3","e":"nice","d":"2026-11-04","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Beth Gaspich","x":"As we look ahead, our priorities remain clear: execute against the opportunity in CX AI, continue investing in our areas of greatest growth potential and operate with increasing efficiency and discipline.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/04/nice-nice-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NICE 2026 Q3","e":"nice","d":"2026-11-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Beth Gaspich","x":"Additionally, we are taking important steps to shorten the time from customer demand to revenue, streamline our operating model, improve efficiency and position NiCE for greater operating leverage.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/04/nice-nice-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NICE 2026 Q3","e":"nice","d":"2026-11-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Beth Gaspich","x":"We are streamlining these functions to support a more customer-centric approach while increasingly leveraging GSIs and other partners to deploy our platform.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/04/nice-nice-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NICE 2026 Q3","e":"nice","d":"2026-11-04","l":"ai_disruption","r":"analyst","s":"Scott Russell","x":"We're engaging with enterprises that previously selected AI-native point solutions, but are now looking for an end-to-end visibility and control that CXone provides.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/04/nice-nice-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NICE 2026 Q3","e":"nice","d":"2026-11-04","l":"ai_disruption","r":"analyst","s":"Samad Samana","x":"But I guess help me reconcile like the explosive growth that we're seeing at whether some of these AI native start-ups and/or the labs versus the experience where maybe enterprises are deploying AI a bit more slowly with you guys.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/04/nice-nice-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[38,1,6734,0,0,0,4956,1357],[39,1,6488,0,0,0,5145,922],[40,1,8752,0,0,0,7154,1227],[41,1,8739,0,0,0,6631,1701],[42,1,7626,0,0,0,5850,1389],[43,1,7691,0,0,0,5891,1291],[44,1,9631,0,0,0,7590,1619],[45,1,5710,0,0,0,4804,635],[46,1,8017,0,0,0,6658,1053],[47,1,5814,0,0,0,4683,859],[63,1,7365,0,0,0,2233,4436],[66,1,7681,0,0,0,6165,1000],[67,1,9846,0,0,0,3365,6092]],"cinema":[[38,1,6734,0,0,0,4956,1357],[39,1,6488,0,0,0,5145,922],[40,1,8752,0,0,0,7154,1227],[41,1,8739,0,0,0,6631,1701],[42,1,7626,0,0,0,5850,1389],[43,1,7691,0,0,0,5891,1291],[44,1,9631,0,0,0,7590,1619],[45,1,5710,0,0,0,4804,635],[46,1,8017,0,0,0,6658,1053],[47,1,5814,0,0,0,4683,859],[63,1,7365,0,0,0,2233,4436],[66,1,7681,0,0,0,6165,1000],[67,1,9846,0,0,0,3365,6092]],"imax":[[38,1,6734,0,0,0,4956,1357],[39,1,6488,0,0,0,5145,922],[40,1,8752,0,0,0,7154,1227],[41,1,8739,0,0,0,6631,1701],[42,1,7626,0,0,0,5850,1389],[43,1,7691,0,0,0,5891,1291],[44,1,9631,0,0,0,7590,1619],[45,1,5710,0,0,0,4804,635],[46,1,8017,0,0,0,6658,1053],[47,1,5814,0,0,0,4683,859],[63,1,7365,0,0,0,2233,4436],[66,1,7681,0,0,0,6165,1000],[67,1,9846,0,0,0,3365,6092]],"streaming":[[38,1,6734,1,1,0,4956,1357],[39,1,6488,0,0,0,5145,922],[40,1,8752,0,0,0,7154,1227],[41,1,8739,0,0,0,6631,1701],[42,1,7626,1,1,0,5850,1389],[43,1,7691,1,1,0,5891,1291],[44,1,9631,0,0,0,7590,1619],[45,1,5710,0,0,0,4804,635],[46,1,8017,0,0,0,6658,1053],[47,1,5814,0,0,0,4683,859],[63,1,7365,0,0,0,2233,4436],[66,1,7681,0,0,0,6165,1000],[67,1,9846,0,0,0,3365,6092]],"dtc":[[38,1,6734,0,0,0,4956,1357],[39,1,6488,0,0,0,5145,922],[40,1,8752,0,0,0,7154,1227],[41,1,8739,0,0,0,6631,1701],[42,1,7626,0,0,0,5850,1389],[43,1,7691,0,0,0,5891,1291],[44,1,9631,0,0,0,7590,1619],[45,1,5710,0,0,0,4804,635],[46,1,8017,0,0,0,6658,1053],[47,1,5814,0,0,0,4683,859],[63,1,7365,0,0,0,2233,4436],[66,1,7681,0,0,0,6165,1000],[67,1,9846,0,0,0,3365,6092]],"ai_spend":[[38,1,6734,0,0,0,4956,1357],[39,1,6488,0,0,0,5145,922],[40,1,8752,0,0,0,7154,1227],[41